522b</link><description>工具作者自述：上传一张照片，生成模型约 40 秒出带纹理的网格，全程在浏览器完成，可导出 GLB、OBJ 或 STL 直接进 Blender、Unity 或 Three.js，每天免费试用两次。</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 17:31:59 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">b5f568aa499b2127ce26732f5490350e6d95ea28</guid><source url="https://dev.to/imageto3d/turning-photos-into-3d-models-in-the-browser-how-image-to-3d-works-522b">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>《GTA 6》首日销售额达 37.9 亿美元，创下娱乐产品史上最大首发纪录</title><link>https://www.gamesindustry.biz/gta-6-hits-379-billion-in-its-first-day-on-sale-becoming-the-biggest-entertainment-launch-in-history</link><description>Rockstar 宣布《GTA 6》首日零售额 37.9 亿美元，刷新全娱乐品类的首发纪录，给独立开发者一个衡量市场天花板的最新参照。</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 20:24:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">b557cf01bc22033d5db2e228c9fc5e746fb16044</guid><source url="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/gta-6-hits-379-billion-in-its-first-day-on-sale-becoming-the-biggest-entertainment-launch-in-history">GamesIndustry.biz</source></item><item><title>GTA 6 正式成为史上最大的娱乐产品首发</title><link>https://80.lv/articles/gta-6-is-officially-the-biggest-entertainment-launch-in-history</link><description>Rockstar 确认 GTA 6 首日零售额近 40 亿美元，超越所有行业的娱乐产品首发纪录，值得独立开发者研究它如何把期待值转化为销量。</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 20:58:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">aecda425cee6047d99e8c10e91dbc05ab5733f80</guid><source url="https://80.lv/articles/gta-6-is-officially-the-biggest-entertainment-launch-in-history">80 Level</source></item><item><title>《侠盗猎车手 VI》成为史上首发规模最大的游戏</title><link>https://www.gamedeveloper.com/business/grand-theft-auto-vi-is-officially-the-biggest-video-game-launch-ever</link><description>《GTA VI》首日零售额达 37.9 亿美元、发售前已卖出 3250 万份，创下游戏史上最大首发纪录，独立开发者可以从中一窥 3A 级发行的体量与打法。</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 21:50:59 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">8667bb7ce0b36a47d42d0d5ca3c18029c1c74ee0</guid><source url="https://www.gamedeveloper.com/business/grand-theft-auto-vi-is-officially-the-biggest-video-game-launch-ever">Game Developer</s